WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Sweep the first to second floors, 100 cubic meters, the first to third floors, 150 cubic meters

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,600
I just started a new mission

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,820
What mission? Are there any rewards?

4
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:13,820
Clean up the mall, clear the first floor in total, and get fifty cubic meters of space.

5
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:17,820
Clear to the second floor, one hundred, clear to the third floor, one hundred and fifty

6
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:20,020
Fifty plus one hundred plus one hundred and fifty, wow!

7
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:25,740
That's right, plus the current one hundred, we can hold more five characters in the future

8
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:31,500
There must be a lot of food and electrical appliances in the mall, so stock up.

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,500
The days ahead will be more comfortable

10
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:38,050
Food and electrical appliances are limited, and groceries are available on a limited basis.

11
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:43,050
The space is limited, so stock up on food that will last a long time, and double the number of electrical appliances to avoid having to replace them if they break.

12
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:46,050
That makes sense. Let’s take a rest for an hour to recuperate.
